<title>JAPAN: Sony to launch home-use PCs for Japanese market.</title>
<headline>Sony to launch home-use PCs for Japanese market.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp said on Wednesday it would introduce personal computers (PC) designed for home use for the Japanese market.  </p>
<p>Sony said in a statement that it would hold a news conference on June 3 to announce details of the product launch. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
